      "fixture": [
        "Real kind kube-apiserver, EndpointSlices, ReferenceGrants and controller ServiceAccount.",
        "Local public Octavia WSGI and installed SQLite models. Keystone, Neutron, RPC transport, Amphora inventory and ordinary CRUD completion are fixtures.",
        "Persistent UDP member batches use the installed RPC endpoint and TaskFlow worker and use the real Amphora REST driver over HTTP tunneled in SSH.",
        "Guest uses the installed Flask agent, systemd, Keepalived, IPVS and nftables. Manual veth plumbing connects the namespace directly to the real kind Pod network. Post-network-plug confirms the preattached fixture subnet.",
        "The IPv4 scenario separately records one existing socket after withdrawals. Deployed OpenStack, mTLS, Amphora image packaging and SELinux, VRRP, upgrade and conformance suites are outside scope."
      ]
